 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A member of the class of pyranoindolizinoquinolines that is (4S)-pyrano[3&apos;,4&apos;:6,7]indolizino[1,2-b]quinoline-3,14-dione bearing two additional ethyl substituents at positions 4 and 11 as well as two additional hydroxy substituents at positions 4 and 9. It is the active metabolite of irinotecan and is ~1000 times more active than irinotecan itself.</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">has_role CHEBI:49103</bp:comment>
