 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A carbamate ester that is cytidine in which the hydrogen at position 5 is replaced by fluorine and in which the amino group attached to position 4 is converted to its N-(penyloxy)carbonyl derivative. Capecitabine is a antineoplastic agent used in the treatment of cancers.</bp:comment>
